        <characteristic name="LD" typeId="c751-ec1f-edb8-fd83">9</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Book of Salvation" id="7bfb-df15-7577-d672" hidden="false" page="80" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">If Ezekiel is slain, leave him on the table on his side. Any Dark Angel that reaches his body may retrieve instead of attacking that turn. Until the book is retrieved, all Dark Angels are immune to psycholoy, will never break, and add +1 to their WS. 
If they fail to retrieve the book by the end of the game, they will lose 10 Victory Points</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Standard of Retribution" id="4812-1c27-3bd4-fca1" hidden="false" page="81" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any Dark Angels within 6&quot; of the standard will always inflict at least 1 hit in close combat, even if they lose or draw against an opponent. Note that under these circumstances the opposing model will also score 1 or more hits, which may result in both models being killed.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Standard of Devistation" id="ad60-c0cf-1c67-60e6" hidden="false" page="81" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any Dark Angel within 6&quot; of the standard is allowed to shoot if they are charged by the enemy, just as if the model had been in overwatch</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Standard of Fortitude" id="a822-1588-6171-3460" hidden="false" page="81" publicationId="308f-63b0-ee37-1c6b" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any Dark Angels within 6&quot; of the standard are allowed to move up to 4&quot; and rapid fire in the same turn</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
